msgid "If you just subscribed/downloaded new mods from steam the game needs to be restarted again for the mods to be loaded correctly.\r\n\r\nIf this keeps happening try unsubscribing from the mods in steam and deleting everything inside  \"\\steamapps\\common\\Longvinter\\Longvinter\\Mods\""
